  "description": "Ride Ready frames come with our Industrial Mill finish and Black graphics.\n\nThe GR Scout is made for the moments when the pavement ends and the adventure begins. Crafted from premium titanium, it delivers the smooth, confident ride you want for long miles, rough roads, loose gravel, and everything in between.\n\nAdventure-focused geometry gives you the stability to push deeper into the unknown, while titanium’s natural vibration damping keeps the ride comfortable mile after mile. Whether you're chasing a distant horizon, loading up for a weekend in the woods, or simply taking the long way home, the GR Scout is built to keep going.\n\nGo farther. Ride longer. Build it once. Ride it for a lifetime.",
